AltoStaking::updateContainer()
├── when caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert
└── when caller is owner
    ├── given container is deprecated
    │   └── it should revert
    ├── given container does not exist
    │   └── it should revert during validation
    └── given valid container exists and is not deprecated
        ├── given valid multiplier
        │   ├── when multiplier is non-zero
        │   │   ├── it should update container multiplier
        │   │   ├── it should update container data
        │   │   ├── it should emit ContainerMultiplierUpdated event
        │   │   ├── it should emit ContainerUpdated event
        │   │   └── when checking max multiplier container updates
        │   │       └── it should update max multiplier container id if new multiplier is highest
        │   └── when multiplier is zero
        │       └── it should revert
        ├── given invalid multiplier greater than MATH_PRECISION
        │   └── it should revert
        └── when updating with same multiplier but different container data
            └── it should update container data while preserving multiplier
